# The previous site's stylesheet and script. Only the rollback copies in
# _pre-launch-backup/ reference them, and that folder does not deploy either.
# Leading slash matters: unanchored these would also match the five demo
# sites' own styles.css and script.js and ship them unstyled.
/styles.css
/script.js
